flowchart LR
  %% devops-ia-production: Arquitetura atual
  %% Render: mermaid.live ou mmdc

  Repo[(GitHub Repository<br/>code + manifests)]
  Repo -->|push/merge| GA[GitHub Actions CI]

  subgraph TF[Terraform IaC]
    TF0[00-remote-backend-stack-ai<br/>S3 state]:::tf
    TF1[01-networking-stack-ai<br/>VPC + subnets + NAT]:::tf
    TF2[02-eks-stack-ai<br/>EKS + Node Group + ECR]:::tf
    TF3[03-ci-cd-stack-ai<br/>OIDC + IAM Role]:::tf
    TF0 --> TF1 --> TF2 --> TF3
  end

  subgraph AWS[AWS Account]
    State[(S3 Remote Backend<br/>Terraform state)]:::aws
    TF0 --> State

    OIDC[OIDC Provider<br/>GitHub to AWS]:::aws
    Role[IAM Role<br/>AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity]:::aws
    ECR[(Amazon ECR<br/>backend + frontend)]:::aws

    subgraph VPC[VPC Multi-AZ us-east-1]
      Pub[Subnets publicas]:::net
      Priv[Subnets privadas]:::net
      NAT[NAT Gateway]:::net
      Pub --- NAT
      NAT --- Priv

      subgraph EKS[EKS Cluster 1.32]
        API[Kubernetes API]:::k8s
        CNI[AWS VPC CNI]:::k8s
        NG[Managed Node Group<br/>t3.small 4 nodes AL2023]:::k8s
        API --- NG
        CNI --- NG

        subgraph NS_ARGOCD[namespace argocd]
          Argo[ArgoCD]:::k8s
        end

        subgraph NS_DEFAULT[namespace default]
          FE[Frontend 2 replicas]:::k8s --> SFE[svc/frontend]:::k8s
          BE[Backend 2 replicas]:::k8s --> SBE[svc/backend]:::k8s
        end

        subgraph NS_MONITORING[namespace monitoring]
          VM[vmsingle VictoriaMetrics]:::obs
          VMA[vmagent scraper]:::obs
          GF[Grafana]:::obs
          KSM[kube-state-metrics]:::obs
          NE[node-exporter DaemonSet]:::obs
          VMA -->|remote_write| VM
          GF -->|query| VM
          KSM -->|metrics| VMA
          NE -->|metrics| VMA
        end
      end
    end
  end

  %% CI
  GA -->|OIDC login| OIDC
  OIDC --> Role
  Role -->|push images| ECR

  %% GitOps
  GA -->|commit update image tags| Repo
  Argo -->|poll manifests| Repo
  Argo -->|apply manifests| API

  %% Runtime
  NG -->|pods pull images| ECR

  %% Monitoring scrape
  VMA -.->|scrape| NS_DEFAULT
  VMA -.->|scrape| NS_ARGOCD

  classDef tf fill:#f7fafc,stroke:#4a5568,color:#2d3748;
  classDef aws fill:#fffaf0,stroke:#b7791f,color:#744210;
  classDef net fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#2b6cb0,color:#1a365d;
  classDef k8s fill:#f3f0ff,stroke:#6b46c1,color:#322659;
  classDef obs fill:#f0fff4,stroke:#276749,color:#1c4532;
